><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face</strong> fierce enemies in fluid, fast-paced, mobility-based combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/0fc025763d1266c9ce03e2b9f6e1c1de.avif?t=1764945762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras_big/0fc025763d1266c9ce03e2b9f6e1c1de.webp?t=1764945762 width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/4e7b7a6e96d9036e9002a7ae2e93e120.poster.avif?t=1764945762\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/4e7b7a6e96d9036e9002a7ae2e93e120.webm?t=1764945762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse environments with fluidity: swing, launch yourself from anchor point to anchor point, and carve your own path. Follow the traces left by those of your Order who attempted the quest before you, and push ever deeper toward Exoria, the mythical lost blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/8525616605c3cafa0dd3f571014fcf13.avif?t=1764945762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras_big/8525616605c3cafa0dd3f571014fcf13.webp?t=1764945762 width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/1cad045276c71873133ecf2dbabfee9d.poster.avif?t=1764945762\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/1cad045276c71873133ecf2dbabfee9d.webm?t=1764945762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Use your grappling hook to manipulate the environment and overcome the trials standing in your way. Unseal blocked passages, move ancient structures, and reveal forgotten paths. Nothing can hold you back if you master your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/e776ea60981203a361fa249862c28e43.avif?t=1764945762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras_big/e776ea60981203a361fa249862c28e43.webp?t=1764945762 width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/b4c245d304be7f1d7cac77e8236b0dba.poster.avif?t=1764945762\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/b4c245d304be7f1d7cac77e8236b0dba.webm?t=1764945762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>In combat, your grappling hook becomes a true weapon. Pull enemies toward you to punish them in close combat, tear off their defenses with precise moves, and turn explosive foes into living projectiles. Chain movement, dodges, and attacks with surgical precision: mastering motion is both your best defense and your strongest asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras/3dad77268a591e39194b15600e92de35.avif?t=1764945762\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143020/extras_big/3dad77268a591e39194b15600e92de35.webp?t=1764945762 width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exoria delivers an experience that rewards fluidity, timing, and initiative. The more you tame your grappling hook, the more the world opens to you. Explore. Adapt. Master your rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And above all: <strong>Find Exoria.</strong></p>",
